{"partie":"beta3","galaxie":"galaxie2","forum":4,"topic":4057,"titre":"Enchère : 1 pack de ressources","forum_nom":"Marché galactique : discussions commerciales","pages":1,"messages":{"1":[{"auteur":"Demonia","avatar":"archivesbeta.apocalypsis.org/beta3/galaxie_2/forums_galactiques/avatars/1699.jpg","date_sans_annee":"18/06 16:13","score":0,"id":96995,"texte":"Dans cette salle, mise aux enchères d'un pack de ressources :\n\n100 mo de métaux\n1 000 mo d'énergie\n10 mo de diamants\n\nLe tout pour la modique somme de 7 ma de leems.\n\nTransport à votre charge.\n\nFin des enchères demain à 20h.\n\nBonnes enchères."},{"auteur":"Booster","avatar":"archivesbeta.apocalypsis.org/beta3/galaxie_2/forums_galactiques/avatars/1324.jpg","date_sans_annee":"18/06 16:13","soutien":1,"score":0,"id":96996,"texte":"7 Ma"},{"auteur":"anuboss","avatar":"archivesbeta.apocalypsis.org/beta3/galaxie_2/forums_galactiques/avatars/1431.jpg","date_sans_annee":"18/06 16:29","score":0,"id":97018,"texte":"10ma"},{"auteur":"Soldiers73000","date_sans_annee":"18/06 16:31","score":0,"id":97023,"texte":"Euh tu ne peut vraiment pas t'occuper du transport ?"},{"auteur":"Arthérius","avatar":"archivesbeta.apocalypsis.org/beta3/galaxie_2/forums_galactiques/avatars/723.gif","date_sans_annee":"18/06 16:52","score":0,"id":97043,"texte":"Je m'occupperai du transport si vous voulez Démonia ..."},{"auteur":"Master W","avatar":"archivesbeta.apocalypsis.org/beta3/galaxie_2/forums_galactiques/avatars/1451.jpg","date_sans_annee":"18/06 17:05","score":0,"id":97062,"texte":"11Ma"},{"auteur":"neo sound","avatar":"archivesbeta.apocalypsis.org/beta3/galaxie_2/forums_galactiques/avatars/1057.jpg","date_sans_annee":"18/06 17:21","score":0,"id":97074,"texte":"12ma"},{"auteur":"Anko","avatar":"archivesbeta.apocalypsis.org/beta3/galaxie_2/forums_galactiques/avatars/983.gif","date_sans_annee":"18/06 17:24","score":0,"id":97077,"texte":"13 ma"},{"auteur":"anubis le mage","avatar":"archivesbeta.apocalypsis.org/beta3/galaxie_2/forum